---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Installation — Cortex">
  <h1>Installation</h1>

  <h2>From Marketplace</h2>
  <ol>
    <li>Open VS Code</li>
    <li>Go to Extensions (<code>Ctrl+Shift+X</code>)</li>
    <li>Search for <strong>Cortex</strong></li>
    <li>Click <strong>Install</strong></li>
  </ol>

  <h2>From VSIX</h2>
  <pre><code>code --install-extension cortex-0.1.0.vsix</code></pre>

  <h2>First Run</h2>
  <ol>
    <li>Open the Cortex sidebar (click the ⚡ icon)</li>
    <li>Click <strong>"Abrir OpenCode"</strong> to connect your AI provider</li>
    <li>Select a provider and authenticate</li>
    <li>Start chatting!</li>
  </ol>

  <h2>Requirements</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>VS Code 1.85+</li>
    <li>An AI provider API key (OpenAI, Anthropic, etc.)</li>
  </ul>
</Layout>

<style>
  h1 { margin-top: 3rem; }
  h2 { margin-top: 2rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
  ol, ul { margin-left: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: var(--text-muted); }
  li { margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
  code {
    background: var(--surface);
    padding: 0.15rem 0.4rem;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }
  pre {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 1rem;
    overflow-x: auto;
  }
  pre code { background: none; padding: 0; }
</style>
